Value Required POLICY (\S+)
Value TYPE (Forward|Local)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)

# "display ip policy-based-route setup": each applied policy, its type (Forward: packets
# arriving on the interface; Local: locally generated packets) and the interface. Any
# other type (one applied to every interface, say) is not a row this table can read.
Start
  ^Policy name\s+Type\s+Interface\s*$$
  ^${POLICY}\s+${TYPE}\s+${INTERFACE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^.* -> Error "unrecognized display ip policy-based-route setup line"
